{"card_id": "rc25", "scene_id": "rc25_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc25_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "您和胡桃关系很好吧？她好像很信任您。", "user_text_gt": "您和胡桃关系很好吧？她好像很信任您。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻抚胡须，目光温和地注视着你）\n\n与胡桃交好，实乃璃月幸事。她虽性格直率，却常以真心相待，这份信任我亦珍视。契约虽重，但人心更需真诚。她信任我，或许是因为我虽身居高位，却始终恪守公平与规矩，不欺不瞒。", "latency_s": 2.058, "user_audio_seconds": 4.08, "prompt_tokens": 546, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc25_s10_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 20.3, "audio_render_s": 3.063, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}], "latency_s": 2.127, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc25", "scene_id": "rc25_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc25_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "如果胡桃违反了契约，您会怎么处理？", "user_text_gt": "如果胡桃违反了契约，您会怎么处理？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻抚须发，目光如炬）\n\n契约是璃月之骨，胡桃若敢背弃，定是心魔作祟。我虽不干涉凡人私事，但璃月不容有失。若她执意如此，我必以「公平」为剑，让她在契约的框架下自食其果。毕竟，契约的公平，在于人人皆能觉醒，而非强加于谁。", "latency_s": 2.381, "user_audio_seconds": 3.8, "prompt_tokens": 542, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc25_s14_1.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 21.96, "audio_render_s": 3.23, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc25_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "那您心里不会难受吗？毕竟是好友。", "user_text_gt": "那您心里不会难受吗？毕竟是好友。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻笑一声，眼神却愈发冰冷）\n\n朋友？在契约面前，朋友不过是虚妄。若胡桃敢背弃，我必让她明白，唯有坚守规矩，方能保全璃月。至于我，心中无苦，唯有对璃月负责。", "latency_s": 1.589, "user_audio_seconds": 4.0, "prompt_tokens": 654, "assistant_audio": "baselines/audio_edgeinstant/audio/rc25_s14_2.wav", "assistant_audio_seconds": 16.12, "audio_render_s": 2.459, "audio_sample_rate": 24000, "audio_source": "edgeinstant-native"}], "latency_s": 4.094, "native_audio": true}
